WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:05.990
The freeze cloud rushed toward Roxy.

2
00:00:05.991 --> 00:00:08.627
She jumped behind a trash can.

3
00:00:08.628 --> 00:00:13.185
"You can't get away from me!" Switch Witch cried.

4
00:00:13.186 --> 00:00:15.862
She flew higher and—

5
00:00:15.863 --> 00:00:18.915
whoosh! Another freeze cloud blew straight toward

6
00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:22.219
Roxy. Roxy looked around fast and saw a food truck

7
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:24.825
nearby. Steam rose from the food truck's cooking

8
00:00:24.826 --> 00:00:30.244
area. "I know!" Roxy thought. "I'll switch the freeze breath with that warm

9
00:00:30.245 --> 00:00:33.684
steam!" Roxy made the freeze cloud

10
00:00:33.685 --> 00:00:38.467
shimmer. When it reached Roxy, it felt like a blast of warm

11
00:00:38.468 --> 00:00:42.076
air. "Yes!" she thought. "I did

12
00:00:42.077 --> 00:00:48.544
it!" "Not bad, Rocket Girl!" Switch Witch yelled. "Try switching

13
00:00:48.545 --> 00:00:52.711
this!" Whiz-hoo! Switch Witch used Roxy's eye laser beams.

14
00:00:52.712 --> 00:00:55.740
Roxy ducked, and the beams missed her.

15
00:00:55.741 --> 00:00:59.207
Then she darted around the corner of a building.

16
00:00:59.208 --> 00:01:02.531
"I need to get closer to Switch Witch," Roxy thought.

17
00:01:02.532 --> 00:01:06.052
"That's the only way to get my powers back."

18
00:01:06.053 --> 00:01:08.529
She peeked out from the side of the building.

19
00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:11.574
On the sidewalk Switch Witch was yelling at more people.

20
00:01:11.575 --> 00:01:19.446
"Hand over your wallets and purses—right now!" Soon her sack was full.

21
00:01:19.447 --> 00:01:21.641
"Hmm," Roxy thought.

22
00:01:21.642 --> 00:01:26.348
She spotted a truck with big bags of cement mix. "That's it!"

23
00:01:26.349 --> 00:01:30.386
When Switch Witch wasn’t looking, Roxy made the sack shimmer.

24
00:01:30.387 --> 00:01:34.039
Then she switched it with a heavy bag of cement mix.

25
00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:36.302
Switch Witch grabbed the sack.

26
00:01:36.303 --> 00:01:41.485
She tried to fly, but the cement pulled her straight down.

27
00:01:41.486 --> 00:01:43.985
"Gah!" Switch Witch shouted.

28
00:01:43.986 --> 00:01:46.741
She saw her sack sitting on the bed of a truck.

29
00:01:46.742 --> 00:01:48.983
She flew straight toward the truck.

30
00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:50.833
Roxy slipped up behind her.

31
00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:55.859
Before the witch spotted her, Roxy made them both shimmer.

32
00:01:55.860 --> 00:02:00.544
"Yes!" Roxy cried as she shot up into the air.

33
00:02:00.545 --> 00:02:03.422
"I've got my powers back!"

34
00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:06.057
Switch Witch shook her fist.

35
00:02:06.058 --> 00:02:11.463
Roxy laughed. "Too bad you can only switch something one time.

36
00:02:11.464 --> 00:02:15.741
You were right, Switch Witch. Your switch power stinks!"

37
00:02:15.742 --> 00:02:20.213
"Drat!" Switch Witch said. ***

38
00:02:20.214 --> 00:02:23.170
Soon Roxy was back at school.

39
00:02:23.171 --> 00:02:26.952
"Hey, guys!" Roxy said. "What did I miss?"

40
00:02:26.953 --> 00:02:30.649
"We finally picked a prize," Mara said.

41
00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:37.164
Jack held up a bag. "We got the spooky stickers. I want the ghosts."

42
00:02:37.165 --> 00:02:40.206
"Can I have the monsters?" Mara asked.

43
00:02:40.207 --> 00:02:46.096
"Sure," Jack said. "Terrell, do you want the mummies or the witches?"

44
00:02:46.097 --> 00:02:49.024
"I'll take the mummies," Terrell said.

45
00:02:49.025 --> 00:02:51.991
"That leaves me with the witch stickers."

46
00:02:51.992 --> 00:02:54.951
Roxy frowned as she took the last sticker sheet.

47
00:02:54.952 --> 00:02:58.194
"You don't like witches?" Mara asked.

48
00:02:58.195 --> 00:03:02.746
Terrell held up his sticker sheet. "Roxy, do you want to switch?"

49
00:03:02.747 --> 00:03:07.958
Roxy grinned. "Yes!"

